<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on Aug 1.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on Aug 1.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				   Aug 1		July 31</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.040		  5.014</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  12.409		 22.496</p>
<p>Cash balance		  17.449		 27.511</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,283.782	     5,287.052</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $308 million were issued and $51 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
